WEBVTT

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:28.940
Our surveillance target is currently 
moving towards the Daimon Area.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.170
Confirmed.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.990
Also confirmed.

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:40.060
I will continue to tail him.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.160
Had enough already?

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:56.660
A citizen of Satellite isn't 
worthy of a D-Wheel or a deck.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:01.460
Your D-Wheel and deck are both property 
of the Public Maintenance Department.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:06.200
It seems the Director has an 
interest in your belongings.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:11.400
They're being thoroughly inspected 
in the security vault.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:50.370
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:55.370
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:55.490 --> 00:02:03.860
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:09.870
Break through even further

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:15.380
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:22.530
There's always only one truth

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:26.420
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:31.210
With your unwavering emotions

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:37.310
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:11.580
Special Pursuit Deck Returns  
Regain the Bond With Your Friends

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:36.700
Yusei, take this card.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:40.960
At a store downtown named Bootleg, 
there's a man named Saiga.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:44.520
If you show him this, he'll help you.

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:07.530
What is it, kid?  Got 
separated from your mom?

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:12.270
This isn't the lost children 
center.  Hurry up and go home.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.410
He says he's lost.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.500
I'd like some milk.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.980
Are you making fun of me, kid?

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.060
He told me about this place.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.760
It's on the house.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:48.660
Saiga is one of these people?

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:53.690
Kid…

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:56.960
After you finish drinking, go home quietly.

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:49.730
Oh no!

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:52.440
Track the marker's signal!

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:55.780
No way!

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:57.260
What's going on?

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.560
For now, inform the director!

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:11.920
This is enough to block the marker's signal.

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:13.460
You're…

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.010
I'm Saiga.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.420
Who are you?

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:40.920
I don't know either, but I 
can acquire almost anything.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:44.300
I guess you can say that 
I'm a Jack-of-all-trades.

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:48.070
You don't have to worry about my fee.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:52.970
Before Himuro went into the detention 
center, he had me hold on to his money.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.660
So what can I do for you?

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.640
I'm going to sneak into the 
security vault building.

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:01.260
What?

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.070
I want you to help me.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:06.100
Yeah…

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.630
Machina Sniper…

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:47.970
That was easy.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:49.370
I found it.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:54.500
It seems your precious D-Wheel is 
on the top floor of the vault .

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:59.510
I'll search for the password 
for the lock on the door.

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.820
I should be able to do it.

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:03.040
You…

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.510
You used to be a duelist?

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:09.770
Hey!  Stop touching other people's stuff!

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.840
A D-Wheeler specializing in tag duels.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:15.610
I wasn't officially a pro.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:19.100
I was a broken duelist 
in an exhibition league.

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:22.100
That's all I was.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:28.270
Stop messing with that and come over here!

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:33.980
How's it going?

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.180
I acquired the password.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.730
Impressive.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:44.880
I'm willing to bet that you're going 
to end up back at the detention center.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:49.080
I have something I need to do.  That's all.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:54.160
That doesn't matter to me.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:04.590
You probably think you've defeated me,

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:08.890
but that's not going to happen, 
you garbage from Satellite.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.320
I will go after him!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:20.170
No matter what anyone says, I'll 
chase him out of Neo Domino City!

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:23.060
Starting today, I'm working exclusively 
for the investigation department.

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:24.070
Ushio!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:29.490
I received authorization!  
I'll chase you everywhere!

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:52.400
Here's everything you'll need.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.880
The rest depends on your luck.

00:09:57.980 --> 00:10:02.960
Answer me.  Why are you going when you 
know that you'll be end up being captured?

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:06.410
Because the bond with my friends is there.

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:10.050
All I'm doing is going to get it back.

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.490
Friends?

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:15.640
You're doing this for something that lame?

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:23.130
Yeah, I understand.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:26.300
I used to have a friend too.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:36.370
But the only thing he left behind was this 
emotionless reality of deep despair and living death.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:44.660
A bond with your friends?  
That's just an illusion.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:48.380
Before long, all you'll 
do is think of yourself,

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:52.460
so you'll hurt and use others 
so that you can survive.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.610
Just like me.

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:11.040
Saiga!

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:12.200
Yuji!

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:13.290
Yuji!

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:14.950
Yuji!

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:29.540
Yuji…

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.150
Yuji!

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:34.430
Yuji!

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:37.670
The lucky one survived.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:41.660
However, I never rode a D-Wheel again.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:45.540
It's the same as being dead.

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:52.510
This card is the remnant of our bond.

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:58.170
After the accident, he 
only sent me this card.

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:03.780
He was insinuating that I had forsaken him.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:08.990
Risk your life for a friend?

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:12.130
In the end, that's impossible to do!

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:17.440
In that case, it's better not to 
make friends in the first place.

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:49.530
How lame.

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:42.440
I'm surprised.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:47.670
I knew you would try something, 
but garbage is garbage.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:51.440
I can't believe you tried to 
sneak into the security vault.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:53.080
So scary.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:56.190
This belongs to me and my friends.

00:14:56.190 --> 00:15:01.130
You're wrong.  Everything held 
here belongs to Neo Domino City.

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:07.070
Let me also add that the lives of Satellite 
garbage belong to this city also!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.810
I'll send you back to the 
detention center again.

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:12.360
After him!

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:20.600
That's what I call a rat in a 
trap!  Give up, you garbage!

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:35.400
Stop!

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:37.110
After him!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:39.900
You punk!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:51.690
You fool!  Did you really think 
you could escape from me?

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.020
Hurry up and give up!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:16:01.720
C'mon, you can at least 
participate in our conversation!

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:06.940
If you can't, then why don't you talk 
to me with your cards, like a duelist?

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:07.970
What?

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:12.920
I forcibly activate a Field 
Spell!  Set on Speed World!

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:17.620
Duel mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:23.420
Duel mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:29.240
The bond with my friends…

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.910
I accept this duel.

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:34.610
Duel!

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:38.200
I go first.  I draw.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:41.340
I summon Quillbolt Hedgehog 
in defense position.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:49.470
If I could just escape 
through that opening…

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:53.630
It's my turn.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.270
I draw!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:17:01.010
From my hand, I summon Search 
Striker in attack position!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:07.480
Search Striker!  Crush that 
Satellite punk's lame monster!

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:10.070
Cleaver Strike!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:20.470
I set one card and end my turn!

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:22.170
It's my turn.

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:28.420
From my hand, I summon the 
Tuner Monster Junk Synchron.

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:37.390
When Junk Synchron is successfully 
summoned, I can Special Summon

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:40.930
a Level 2-or-below monster from 
my graveyard in defense position.

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:42.210
What?

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:45.110
Resurrect, Quillbolt Hedgehog.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:54.650
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 2 Quillbolt Hedgehog.

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:05.920
You're Synchro Summoning right now?  How 
arrogant of you when all you are is garbage.

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:11.830
The stars come together to call forth a new 
power!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:13.920
Synchro Summon!

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:16.820
Come, Junk Warrior!

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.010
I won't let you do that!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:28.480
I activate my trap Discord Counter!

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:31.180
This card negates your 
Synchro Summon and returns

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:34.380
the Synchro Material Monsters to 
the field in defense position!

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:40.470
In other words, Junk Warrior separates 
into Quillbolt Hedgehog and Junk Synchron!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.990
Furthermore, due to the 
effect of Discord Counter,

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:53.250
you are not allowed to summon a monster 
until the End Phase of your next turn!

00:18:56.950 --> 00:19:00.010
My priority is to escape 
through that opening.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:08.870
All right.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.360
I won't let you.

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:27.020
Close A5 and A7 barrier walls!

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.860
Next is the east sector.

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:42.540
I know how garbage thinks.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:48.020
Dance!  Spin!  Flee!

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:51.530
I'll drive you deeper into a corner!

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:56.300
I'll teach you that you're 
nothing but garbage!

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:59.810
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:04.910
From my hand, I summon Pursuit 
Chaser in attack position.

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:15.970
Then Search Striker and Pursuit Chaser 
attack your two Satellite scrap iron monsters!

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:18.870
Fire!

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:31.150
Due to Pursuit Chaser's monster effect, when 
it destroys a monster in defense position,

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:33.200
you take 500 points of damage!

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:42.790
Then I set one card in 
my hand and end my turn.

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:44.490
My turn.

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:49.760
I set one card.

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:51.560
I end my turn.

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:55.050
Just like I thought.

00:20:55.050 --> 00:21:01.640
Due to my Discord Counter, you 
can't summon a monster this turn!

00:21:01.680 --> 00:21:04.940
All the roads have been blocked!

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:16.930
You no longer have an escape route!

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:20.190
The only thing ahead of you 
is a dead end!  Give up!

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:23.020
All you can do is surrender!

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:25.220
Keep going!

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:27.070
You're… Saiga.

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:28.580
Just keep going forward!

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:29.360
But…

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.230
Go!

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:38.560
No way!  What is that punk doing?

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:09.000
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:14.390
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:20.320
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:25.560
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:25.750 --> 00:22:28.720
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:34.310
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:41.470
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:41.600 --> 00:22:46.870
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:52.810
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.110 --> 00:22:58.150
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:04.240
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:04.390 --> 00:23:13.660
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
